Then you're going to do source
poky-en-init-build-env, and

54
00:03:39,618 --> 00:03:43,920
what this is doing is using
the source command to pull in a bunch

55
00:03:43,920 --> 00:03:47,335
of variables and
other content related to bash.

56
00:03:47,335 --> 00:03:51,944
That set up your build environment for
