00:03:57,102 --> 00:04:02,272
which will build a minimal image
that's defined in the poky project.

59
00:04:02,272 --> 00:04:04,702
And then you go and
work on something else for

60
00:04:04,702 --> 00:04:07,797
a few hours because this will
take quite a while to do it.

61
00:04:07,797 --> 00:04:11,944
As I mentioned before, if it's
building all the tools from scratch,

62
00:04:11,944 --> 00:04:16,388
the initial build takes a very long
time Yocto even more than then build it.

