74
00:04:58,055 --> 00:05:02,610
So this script is going to set up
environment variables that are going to be

75
00:05:02,610 --> 00:05:03,866
used for bitbake or

76
00:05:03,866 --> 00:05:09,222
whatever other commands we run from the
terminal after we call this source step.

