00:12:41,622 --> 00:12:45,572
So this was done for you as part
of the build script for build it.

186
00:12:45,572 --> 00:12:50,009
And Yocto in instead of using
a defconfig and config format,

187
00:12:50,009 --> 00:12:53,844
like build it does,
Yocto uses a machine variable.

188
00:12:53,844 --> 00:12:57,381
And the machine variables defined
in build conf and local.com,

